  <p>
    Been testing these things for a year now. Here's where I landed:
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Uplift</strong> if you can swing it. Rock solid. Tons of options. Fifteen years of coverage means they stand behind it. I use the V2. The V3 is what they sell now.
